.el .ds Aq '
.TH tapectl-cartridge-register 1  "tapectl-cartridge-register " 
.SH NAME
tapectl\-cartridge\-register \- Register a physical cartridge
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtapectl cartridge register\fR <\fB\-\-barcode\fR> [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] <\fB\-\-media\-type\fR> [\fB\-\-capacity\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-notes\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register a physical cartridge
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-barcode\fR \fI<BARCODE>\fR
Barcode label
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would be done without making changes
.TP
\fB\-\-media\-type\fR \fI<MEDIA_TYPE>\fR
Media type (e.g., LTO\-6, LTO\-7, LTO\-8)
.TP
\fB\-\-capacity\fR \fI<CAPACITY>\fR [default: 2500G]
Nominal capacity (e.g., "2500G")
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-\-notes\fR \fI<NOTES>\fR
Notes
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
